# Files excluded from the EAS Build upload archive.
#
# This repo is a monorepo: the Python RAG backend lives at the root and the
# Expo app lives in mobile-app/. EAS archives from the git root, so without this
# file it uploads ~1 GB of backend data and node_modules that the app build does
# not need. Keep the upload lean by excluding everything but the app sources.
# (When .easignore exists EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore, so it must also list
# the usual node_modules / build-output excludes.)

# --- Python RAG backend (irrelevant to the React Native app build) ---
data/
docs/
src/
tests/
*.pdf
requirements.txt

# --- Node / Expo / native build outputs ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.expo/
mobile-app/android/
mobile-app/ios/
mobile-app/builds/

# --- VCS / scratch ---
.git/
